:: OC Enkys Meeting [nobr]

/* Intro */
Science class has <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Mr. Chang</span> having everyone practice different measurements and the different uses of the various vials and flasks in the classroom. Not a very exciting class, and he only lets you all use the plastic sets since he doesn’t yet trust the class with the glass ones, but at least it goes by nice and easily. Class is nearing its end, and everyone is in the process of putting everything away <span style="color:LightCoral">when you are suddenly bumped from the side and drop one of the small plastic vials.</span> <br>

