    <<ad _ad>>

<span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“S- sorry!”</span> A nervous, high-pitched voice says. You turn and see the same pink-haired boy you saw in the bathroom. He panics, holding his hands up as if he is worried that you were going to yell or swing at him. <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“I- I- I slipped and- I- I’ll get it!”</span> He stutters out, quickly bending down to pick it up. That’s when you see it. <span style="color:Pink">Your eyes naturally fall to his waist, so trained to look there whenever any boy bends down near you, but instead of the expected briefs or boxers poking out, you see something a bit different. Bright, pink frilly underwear. Not like any boy’s underwear you’ve seen before, and you gasp out the color without thinking.</span> <br>
<br>
<span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Wha- what!?”</span> He quickly straights up, <span style="color:Pink">pulling his shirt down and turning bright red.</span> Realizing what you said, you think fast and tell him you were referring to his hair. It’s pink. You think that is pretty cool. <span style="color:Yellow">You give a smile, but the boy continues to look at you nervously.</span> <br>
<br>
