    <span style="color:Pink">As you talk, your eyes fall to his crotch. You remember the flat disk you saw and are curious about what it looks like up close. Plus, that underwear he is wearing.</span> You have so much about this boy you want to ask about and see but decide to just play it friendly for now. You tell him you really like his hair, it’s so cool and colorful. If he ever wants to hang out or anything, you’d love too as well. You’re always looking for new friends. <span style="color:LightGreen">You end your friendly introduction with a smile, which the boy tries to return though still looks very nervous.</span> <br>
    <br>
    <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Th- thank you… I- I-”</span> He gulps, trying to calm himself, <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“I would like that… I- I should get back to my seat though…”</span> He continues to stare at the ground as he hurries back to his table. <span style="color:Pink">He seems like a nice kid, though he is a little too shy for his own good. Still very cute though.</span> <br>
